{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 101,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.8489990234375,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Some of these steps can be automated, making the method quicker and more robust, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        243.0803680419922,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "reducing the risk of contamination.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        524.4119873046875,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "The Hain version 1 and version 2 assays include   probes to detect rifampicin resistance,  rpoB katG",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.952346801757812,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.9459838867188,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "probes to detect mutations associated with high-level isoniazid resistance, and   promoter  inhA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993098258972168,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.98095703125,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "probes to detect mutations usually associated with low-level isoniazid resistance. The probes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        524.3958740234375,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "used to detect wild-type and specific mutations are the same for both versions of the Hain LPA.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979681968688965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.16912841796875,
        526.957763671875,
        192.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "Similarly, the Nipro assay allows for the identification of MTBC, and resistance to rifampicin and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972465515136719,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.66912841796875,
        526.95947265625,
        207.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid. The Nipro assay also differentiates  ,   and   from  M. avium M. intracellulare M. kansasii",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        210.16912841796875,
        253.4311981201172,
        223.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "other non-tuberculous mycobacteria.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        234.17303466796875,
        527.1849975585938,
        247.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "The  ,   and  promoter mutation probes are the same for the three assays, with the  rpoB katG inhA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989044189453125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        249.67303466796875,
        526.9412841796875,
        262.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "exception of the   S315N mutation, which is included in the Nipro assay but not in Hain  katG",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        265.17303466796875,
        527.0031127929688,
        278.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "version 1 or version 2. There are some minor variations in the codon regions covered for the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        280.67303466796875,
        369.70989990234375,
        293.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "wild type among Hain version 1 and version 2, and the Nipro.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        306.1846008300781,
        239.91481018066406,
        322.5645751953125
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        331.3982238769531,
        526.7391357421875,
        344.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "In 2015, WHO commissioned an updated systematic review of the accuracy of commercial",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        346.8982238769531,
        527.0562744140625,
        360.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "LPAs for detecting MTBC, and resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid. A total of 74 studies were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99905014038086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        362.3982238769531,
        527.0278930664062,
        375.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "identified, comprising 94 unique datasets (see   “FL-LPA”). Of these 94 datasets,  Web Annex A.7:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.949685096740723,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        377.8982238769531,
        526.965576171875,
        391.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "83 evaluated Hain version 1, five evaluated Hain version 2, and six evaluated the Nipro assay.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        393.3982238769531,
        526.9260864257812,
        406.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "Only one of the studies performed head-to-head testing of all three target LPAs on directly",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        408.8982238769531,
        527.069091796875,
        422.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "tested clinical specimens and indirectly tested isolates, and these data were included as six",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        424.3982238769531,
        526.9365844726562,
        437.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "separate datasets  . No studies performed LPA testing on specimens and culture isolates from  (9)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968655586242676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        439.8982238769531,
        378.6088562011719,
        453.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "the same patients, precluding direct within-study comparisons.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        463.902099609375,
        527.0142822265625,
        477.047119140625
      ],
      "text": "Following the 2015 systematic review, the WHO Global TB Programme convened a GDG",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        479.402099609375,
        526.84375,
        492.547119140625
      ],
      "text": "in March 2016 to assess the data and update the 2008 policy recommendations on using",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        494.902099609375,
        527.10205078125,
        508.047119140625
      ],
      "text": "commercial LPAs to detect MTBC, and resistance to isoniazid and rifampicin. The PICO questions",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951794624328613,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        510.402099609375,
        190.62130737304688,
        523.547119140625
      ],
      "text": "are given in  Box 2.4.2.1.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        534.4061279296875,
        526.9066772460938,
        547.5511474609375
      ],
      "text": "LPAs were compared with a phenotypic culture-based DST reference standard, and a composite",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        549.9061279296875,
        526.5941772460938,
        563.0511474609375
      ],
      "text": "reference standard that combined the results from genetic sequencing with results from phenotypic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.890000343322754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        565.4061279296875,
        526.92333984375,
        578.5511474609375
      ],
      "text": "culture-based DST. Phenotypic DST was the primary reference standard applied to all participants",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.936969757080078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        580.9061279296875,
        526.918212890625,
        594.0511474609375
      ],
      "text": "for all analyses. These analyses were stratified – first, by susceptibility or resistance to rifampicin or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.937220573425293,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        596.4061279296875,
        483.2843322753906,
        609.5511474609375
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid (or both) and second, by type of LPA testing (indirect testing or direct testing).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 85",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}